{"c":[{"name":"20261022T125611Z-032510e14baefd2f","text":"Operator 2026-10-22: the swap is phase B of the session-start check. Phase A records rehearsed; phase B runs at a later session start, at least a day after a rehearsed record of the same check version: copy again, verify, hard-link the backup, replace. No swap release.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261022T131311Z-231ef0e08e22e082","text":"Exact semantic top-100 over 133,793 vectors, measured 2026-10-22: rank (min distance per owner), cut, then join messages takes 220 ms on 1.5.4 and ~160 ms on 2.0.0; an EXISTS orphan guard 689/320 ms; join-first QUALIFY 1.7/2.0 s.","type":"note"}]}
